Enlightened Figurines — public licence scope
=============================================

This repository contains assets under different licences. The scope below
controls which is which.

1. ORIGINAL 3D MODELS (models/)
   Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
   (CC BY-NC 4.0)

   You may share and adapt these models for non-commercial purposes,
   provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate
   whether changes were made. You may not use them for commercial purposes.

   Full legal code:
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
   Human-readable summary:
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

   Attribution format:
   "Model: <title> by <author>, licensed CC BY-NC 4.0, source: <url>.
    Changes: <none or description>."

2. INSIGHT CARDS, BRAND, LOGO, PHOTOGRAPHY (cards/, brand/, pages/)
   Copyright (c) the project owner. All rights reserved.
   You may show the logo to refer to the project. You may not reuse it as
   your own brand, or reproduce the card text commercially.

3. CODE (any file with an SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT header, or a
   LICENSE file in its directory)
   MIT Licence. See https://opensource.org/license/mit

4. THIRD-PARTY MODELS
   Not relicensed here. See CREDITS.md for the author, source, and licence
   of each. If a third-party model's licence conflicts with this file, the
   third-party licence controls for that model.

5. WHAT THIS LICENCE CANNOT COVER
   These licences cover only rights held by the project owner. They do not
   grant any right in a third-party character, trademark, or sculpture.

NOTE TO MAINTAINER: paste the full CC BY-NC 4.0 legal code below this line
before publishing, and keep the canonical URL above it.
